station.description:
{image}

Your weather station creates its own devices and sensors, so there is nothing to add on this side. What follows is what to type into the station's app.

Open the app, check that the station's firmware is up to date, then open its settings.

timeout.description:
No station has posted in the last {minutes} minutes.{key_hint_extra}

The usual causes are an address the station cannot reach, **Confirm & Exit** not pressed, or a firmware from 3.02 onwards, which requires HTTPS.

The addresses to point it at are:
{urls}
The endpoints listening for uploads are:
{endpoints}

Press Next to finish anyway — the setup is kept, the endpoints start listening for real, and a repair will bring you back here until a station shows up.

